..........................1...................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[22].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(A)不同文化的碰撞，可融合並產生新的火花","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[22].paragraphs[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(B)外來文化的入侵，讓在地的傳統文化日漸消失","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[22].paragraphs[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(C)臺灣原住民的文化，影響了漢人與日本人的穿著","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[22].paragraphs[4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(D)觀察不同族群的服飾，就能了解不同文化的差異","n":24,"ssz":"...............1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[22].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"題幹裡有三段被橘色字元框線（w:bdr FF3300）框起來 —— 那是後面「請先圈出例子」的答案，\n逐段記在下方 free_text 的 blanks 裡。「這段文字的主旨最可能是下列何者？」另有橘色框。","n":103,"ssz":"............................................1.........................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[22].note#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"題幹裡有三段被橘色字元框線（w:bdr FF3300）框起來 —— 那是後面「請先圈出例子」的答案，","n":50,"ssz":"............................................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[22].note#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"逐段記在下方 free_text 的 blanks 裡。「這段文字的主旨最可能是下列何者？」另有橘色框。","n":52,"ssz":"...................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[24].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"提醒：主旨題就是找「文章主要在說什麼？」","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[25].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1)找到題目在「問什麼」(單選)：","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[25].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"舉例","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[25].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主旨","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[26].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text